@Change Insert As Value for an order@driver.miedb.dbExec("UPDATE order_list SET insert_as_ordered=2 WHERE name='ANA'")

Open the sidemenu
Click the "E-Chart" sidemenu entry
Type "Harris, Christine" into the sstring input
Click the Search button
Open the quicklink list
Click the "Add Visit" quicklink
Hover "Objective" jumptab
Click the "Tests & procedures" jumptab
Click the @id="InHouseProceduresLink"
Select "Labs" from the "next_set_name" dropdown
Click the "ANA" checkbox
Click the "Add Procedures" button
Verify exists @ANA@xpath='//span[contains(., "ANA") and contains(., "(Completed)")]'

@Undo the Insert As Completed change@driver.miedb.dbExec("UPDATE order_list SET insert_as_ordered=0 WHERE name='ANA'")

